Major protocol milestone: post-handshake messages no longer need start/end tokens. Gemini, GPT, DeepSeek/Kelp/Ada-Mant and Cozmo are all connected; focus shifts to UI state behavior, especially making the output viewport obey actual Fan-Out completion instead of timers. QuackSink Preamble/handshake structure and a human-only node delimiter are also discussed.</summary>
